      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CS AI Hub · Approval\nRuns only after a CSM has **confirmed the account and approved the action** in the Hub (Gate 2). The AI never triggers this workflow.\n\nWrites an audit row, sends an internal summary and prepares the reply as a **Gmail draft**. Nothing is sent to a customer automatically.\n\n**Colors:** yellow = intake · green = audit · purple = notify and draft",
        "height": 694,
        "width": 1316,
        "color": 7
      },
