      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 3 · Notify and draft\nInternal summary goes to the team mailbox (a separate account, so it cannot loop back into the customer inbox). The customer reply becomes a **draft** in the original mailbox; the CSM reviews, edits and sends it. If an approval carries no prepared reply (for example an AI insight), the reply step is skipped.",
